eers Receive AVCA Team Academic Award, Team Academic Honor Roll Recognition</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/7/23/volleyball-mountaineers-receive-avca-team-academic-award-team-academic-honor-roll-recognition</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/7/23/volleyball-mountaineers-receive-avca-team-academic-award-team-academic-honor-roll-recognition</guid><category>Volleyball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="WVU Volleyball receives the AVCA Team Academic Award and Academic Honor Roll for the 2025-26 season" src="https://admin.wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/7/23/VB26_AVCATeamAcademicAward_1920x1080__1_.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W. Va. – The West Virginia University volleyball team earned its second consecutive American Volleyball Coaches Association (AVCA) Team Academic Award for the 2025-26 season.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://admin.wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/7/23/VB26_AVCATeamAcademicAward_1920x1080__1_.jpg" /><media:content url="https://admin.wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/7/23/VB26_AVCATeamAcademicAward_1920x1080__1_.jpg"><media:title>WVU Volleyball receives the AVCA Team Academic Award and Academic Honor Roll for the 2025-26 season</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://admin.wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/7/23/VB26_AVCATeamAcademicAward_1920x1080__1_.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 12:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>17</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59252</s:story_id></item><item><title>West Virginia, Northwestern to Meet at the Greenbrier</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/7/23/womens-basketball-west-virginia-northwestern-to-meet-at-the-greenbrier</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/7/23/women